/*
 * Implements semantic validation for `mapfor` comprehension/allocator
 * expressions.
 *
 * This module currently acts as a placeholder: the syntactic form is
 * recognized by the parser, but semantic validation and construction of
 * the resulting map value are not yet implemented.
 *
 * Once completed, this module will handle:
 *   - type inference for key/value expressions inside a `mapfor`,
 *   - validation of iteration sources,
 *   - construction of the resulting MapType and MapValue,
 *   - and enforcement of mutability and aliasing rules.

 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::mapfor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/mapfor.yr
 * @Author(s):
